{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do","id":1261685,"title":"GMing Promethean what NOT to do","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-19T18:37:17-07:00","id":1261685,"title":"GMing Promethean what NOT to do","content":"Based on GMing Demon What NOT to do. And GMing changling what NOT to do .<br /> <br /> Promthean GMS what should a Absolutely not do when running Promthean","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-20T07:33:05-07:00","id":1261757,"title":"","content":"Don't let it get too dark. <b>Promethean</b> has the potential to be a real downer, and to an extent that's appropriate, but don't let it be relentlessly sad or grim. You have to let the characters see the good things that humanity does, otherwise the Pilgrimage is meaningless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-20T09:22:18-07:00","id":1261776,"title":"","content":"Don't forget that prometheans are VERY rare, about 100 or less walking the earth at any given time. Anytime you decide to show one as an NPC, emphasise how important it is to meet another one","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-21T06:17:57-07:00","id":1261930,"title":"","content":"How should a not handle torment","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-21T10:06:09-07:00","id":1261950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1261930#post1261930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How should a not handle torment</div> </div> </div> </div>Elaborate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-21T11:30:59-07:00","id":1261960,"title":"","content":"How should the GM not handle Torment. <br /> <br /> Like if I am running a Promthean game and a character goes into torment what should I NOT do","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-21T21:54:14-07:00","id":1262054,"title":"","content":"Just remember that the game is queer as hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T05:23:39-07:00","id":1262337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1261960#post1261960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How should the GM not handle Torment.<br /> <br /> Like if I am running a Promthean game and a character goes into torment what should I NOT do</div> </div> </div> </div>Excessive edge all the time, tie in the Prometheans behavior to what caused him to go Torment","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T10:27:30-07:00","id":1262378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1262054#post1262054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just remember that the game is queer as hell.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> i thought you where boycotting WW and OP","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T11:02:34-07:00","id":1262381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1262378#post1262378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> i thought you where boycotting WW and OP</div> </div> </div> </div>Still am. Doesn\u2019t mean I can\u2019t give advice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T10:16:07-07:00","id":1263084,"title":"","content":"Isn\u2019t the point of the game to assimilate into \u2018normal\u2019 society","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T10:33:13-07:00","id":1263090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1263084#post1263084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn\u2019t the point of the game to assimilate into \u2018normal\u2019 society</div> </div> </div> </div>No. The point of the game is to make a place for yourself in the world through a gradual series of epiphanies about people and why they do things. A deep sense of alienation from the world around you based on your inability to spend a long time in most places without their eventually exploding into mutagen and disaster is generally not the root phenomenon separating marginalized identities from the predominant social groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:36:45-08:00","id":1265494,"title":"","content":"Queer people <i>are</i> normal.<br /> <br /> Anyway.<br /> <br /> The reason Prometheans don't fit in is because they carry a piece of (stolen!) Divine Fire and, man, does that poison the world against you. It echoes the queer experience (the negative parts of that experience, I mean) in the sense of being persecuted for something you just <i>are</i>. It's also a queer narrative in the sense of finding your people and your place in a hostile world.<br /> <br /> Where it is <b>not</b> a queer narrative, is 1) Disquiet forces people's hands, and even the kindest soul eventually succumbs to it. In the real world, being a hateful bigot is wrong, and all on the hateful bigot to fix. 2) The solution is achieving New Dawn, which may or may not (more on that) involve shedding the Divine Fire, whereas no one should have to stop being queer to be accepted.<br /> <br /> On the topic of New Dawn: Maybe you get to keep your Divine Fire. Maybe the Pilgrimage lets you incorporate it, so it becomes yours instead of stolen. The Core deliberately doesn't delve too much into &quot;what after the New Dawn&quot; because it's a personal decision based on the character and the story you're running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":1713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","user":"mistress of whispers","date":". 11-08-2018, 08:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T05:51:18-08:00","id":1265497,"title":"","content":"Anyway, things NOT to do.<br /> <br /> Don't be too heavy handed. In a way you are playing the Divine Principle--you're mapping the Pilgrimage and the milestones, it's your task to guide the characters (and players) through the story, and you decide when to send in the<i> qashmallim</i>. So take a page from its book and, sometimes, do nothing. Just sit back and go 'girl, did you fuck that up &amp; I can't wait to see how you get yourself out of it'. 'Cause the Principle surely (most likely? probably? in its own unknowable way) <i>wants</i> them to succeed, but walking the hard road is also part of succeeding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":1713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","user":"mistress of whispers","date":". 11-08-2018, 08:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-18T01:19:38-08:00","id":1268492,"title":"","content":"While you shouldn\u2019t make it dark as hell, you also shouldn\u2019t downplay any of the unfortunate side effects of being a Promethean. In addition, achieving the New Dawn isn\u2019t something you can just gain over a weekend, it is a long, perilous, heartbreaking journey of self realization and discovery, and that is what makes it worth it. The Pilgrimage is an hyper exaggerated version of what it\u2019s like to be a person in a world that has no time to accept you for being you, dangers and all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-18T09:07:44-08:00","id":1268560,"title":"","content":"To follow up on the last two pieces of advice; be <i>fans </i>of the player characters. Encourage them to advance, to do stuff, to go out into the world and do things. And if <i>that </i>doesn't work, give them a kick up the backside to get them moving. The Principle has Lilithim for a reason, after all.<br /> <br /> Additionally, when designing Milestones, <i>never </i>decide what the &quot;correct&quot; outcome should be. Milestones are choices. They're moments of clarity and understanding. Milestones are about learning how to be human, and there's no wrong way to be human (You can make some freaking awful choices and still be human. Admittedly, killing is a step backwards, so being amongst the worst humanity has to offer is... probably not the Principle's intention). Choice defines the Milestone. Let the characters come to their own conclusions, then award Vitriol based on how impactful it seems to be for the character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-18T16:52:04-08:00","id":1268665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1261685-gming-promethean-what-not-to-do?p=1268560#post1268560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Admittedly, killing is a step backwards</div> </div> </div> </div>Not even just &quot;killing,&quot; in fact! Killing <i>by supernatural means</i> \u2014 including &quot;you wouldn't be able to be this strong/smart/persuasive if you weren't a monster&quot; \u2014 is what makes a given murder a step backwards. You can totally have e.g. &quot;kill somebody to protect your throngmates&quot; be the resolution of a character's milestone and not have it risk losing out on net Pilgrimage gains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}